# Show Shot — Flutter desktop app (macOS, Windows, Linux)
#
# This file has two layers:
#  1. Flutter/Dart — everything the tooling regenerates on `flutter pub get`
#     / `flutter build`. Never commit these; they're per-machine and would
#     just create merge noise.
#  2. OS/IDE — junk files editors and operating systems drop into any repo.
#
# Each platform runner folder (macos/, linux/, windows/) has its own
# .gitignore for Flutter/Xcode/CMake ephemeral output (Pods/, Flutter/
# ephemeral/, DerivedData, etc.) — this file does not duplicate those.

### Flutter / Dart ###
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
.packages
/build/
**/doc/api/
coverage/

# Note: pubspec.lock is intentionally NOT listed here — for an app (not a
# published package) it should stay committed, for reproducible builds.

### Secrets — never commit credentials, even accidentally ###
*.env
.env*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.p12
*.key
.secrets/

### Editors / IDEs ###
# IntelliJ / Android Studio
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws

# VS Code (launch/task configs are opt-in; uncomment to share them)
.vscode/

# Vim / Emacs / Sublime
*~
*.swp
*.swo
*.sublime-workspace

### Logs & OS cruft ###
*.log
.fuse_hidden*
.directory
.Trash-*
.nfs*

